# --- dienr-specific --------------------------------------------------------

# Frozen R reference implementation: a nested git clone, kept locally as the
# behavioral reference. Not vendored because its LICENSE.md (MIT) and
# DESCRIPTION (GPL >=2) disagree; see plan Phase 0.
